# HP39gs stock launch through the original APLET UI and USB disk.
# HP39/40 2.22 RECEIVE FROM order:
#   HP39 (IrDA), HP39/40 (USB), HP39/40 (Ser),
#   USB Disk drive, Ser. Disk drive.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
7000 tap aplet
8000 capture aplet-library
9000 tap f5
10000 capture receive-menu
10500 tap down
11200 tap down
11900 tap down
12200 capture receive-usb-disk
12600 tap enter

31000 capture remote-aplet
32500 tap enter
34000 capture lazy-fetch
35000 host-gate

0 monitor 90000
500 capture fetch-complete
1000 retry enter
11000 retry enter
21000 retry enter
31000 retry enter
46000 retry enter
61000 retry enter
